    "key": "shot_lateral_width_fit_abs",
    "description": "Per completed prior team-match, compute unit-count mean absolute lateral shot displacement |Y-0.5| over non-penalty shots created and conceded. Average latest 8 completed prior league matches, minimum 3. Match scalar = abs(home_attack_width*away_concede_width-away_attack_width*home_concede_width). It measures attack-width/lateral-lane tendency, not xG quality, central-box xG share, temporal concentration, set-piece share, shot-bodypart concentration, lineup continuity, workload or score-state response.",
